<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    English translation. The default locale of this application is French: a panel set to
    any other language falls back to it rather than to English, which is deliberate given
    where these panels are installed. The choice is overridable from the settings, see
    LocaleHelper.

    Every apostrophe is escaped. An unescaped one silently breaks resource compilation,
    and English has a great many of them.
-->
